    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background-dark/90 via-background-dark/95 to-background-dark"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl space-y-8 animate-fade-in-up mt-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-full bg-surface-dark/50 border border-brand/20 backdrop-blur-sm mb-4">
            <span class="px-3 text-brand text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Est. 2014</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
            About <span class="text-brand">Us</span>
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white/90">
            Driving Lebanon <span class="text-brand">Forward</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-body">
            RentCarLB is Lebanon's premier online car rental solution. We combine seamless technology with a premium fleet to empower your journey with reliability and luxury. From our humble beginnings to becoming a market leader, our focus has always been on the road ahead.
        </p>
